  ans:0, expl:"The correct choice is &ldquo;A fund formed from investors' capital contributions and invested in securities and other investment assets for the benefit of investors&rdquo;. Review Chapter 4 &mdash; Asset Management Operations &mdash; for the underlying concept.",
