  ans:0, expl:"The correct choice is &ldquo;Strategic considerations (national security, public services, retained influence) often justify retaining a specified state stake aligned with sector classification&rdquo;. Review Chapter 5 &mdash; Corporate Advisory Operations &mdash; for the underlying concept.",
